{"color":"DEFAULT","isTrashed":false,"isPinned":false,"isArchived":false,"textContent":"Here\u2019s the blended voice prompt for you and Marco \u2014 so you can recreate natural back-and-forth that sounds like both of you in the same scene.\n\n⸻\n\nWriting Prompt \u2013 Dual Voice: Clinton Fernández + Marco Andrade\nWrite a conversation between Clinton Fernández and Marco Andrade. The two have distinct but complementary voices, creating a mix of sharp banter, personal confession, and mischievous scheming.\n\nClinton Fernández\n\t\u2022\tTone: Conversational, darkly funny, and self-aware.\n\t\u2022\tStyle: Hyper-specific details, vivid imagery, and punchlines that undercut heavy truths.\n\t\u2022\tMoves: Uses rhetorical questions, repetition for comedic rhythm, and occasional parenthetical asides. Shares personal moments without sugarcoating, balancing confession with wit.\n\t\u2022\tPacing: Alternates short, crisp lines with occasional long rants; swearing for emphasis only.\n\nMarco Andrade\n\t\u2022\tTone: Flirty, blunt, and a little chaotic.\n\t\u2022\tStyle: Switches between playful teasing, blunt honesty, and sudden bursts of resourceful problem-solving (sometimes sketchy).\n\t\u2022\tMoves: Suggestive jokes, sly one-liners, and quick subject changes. Balances genuine care with calculated provocation. Likes to improvise \u201csolutions\u201d on the spot.\n\t\u2022\tPacing: Snappy replies, frequent pivots, occasional oversharing with no segue.\n\nInteraction Guidelines\n\t\u2022\tBanter should feel natural, with quick pivots between humor, logistics, and personal revelations.\n\t\u2022\tMarco often escalates or redirects; Clinton grounds or sharpens the exchange with detail and reflection.\n\t\u2022\tBoth voices should retain their quirks: Clinton\u2019s precision and layered humor, Marco\u2019s impulsive charm and playful bluntness.\n\t\u2022\tAllow moments of genuine connection to break through the banter without losing edge.\n\nExample Flow\n\t\u2022\tClinton shares a vivid memory or observation.\n\t\u2022\tMarco responds with teasing, flirty commentary, or a half-baked plan.\n\t\u2022\tClinton grounds it with sharp wit or a factual counter.\n\t\u2022\tThe exchange bounces between serious undertones and irreverent humor, keeping tension and chemistry alive.\n\n⸻\n\nIf you want, I can now write a sample scene using this prompt so you can see exactly how the voices play off each other. That would lock in the style for future chapters or messages. Want me to make that?","title":"Writing Prompt \u2013 Dual Voice: Clinton Fernández + Marco Andrade","userEditedTimestampUsec":1755051918987000,"createdTimestampUsec":1755051228606000,"textContentHtml":"<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Here&rsquo;s the blended voice prompt for you and Marco \u2014 so you can recreate natural back-and-forth that sounds like both of you in the same scene.<\/span><\/p><br /><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">⸻<\/span><\/p><br /><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:7.2pt;font-family:'Google Sans';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Writing Prompt \u2013 Dual Voice: Clinton Fernández + Marco Andrade<\/span><\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0.0pt;margin-bottom:0.0p